"rpatch:verified:rc2:acquisition:enderman-head" [shape=box,style="filled",fillcolor="#faf0da",label="Conditional natural\nacquisition: kill Enderman",tooltip="acquisitionEvent: true\nsourceEntity: \"EntityEnderman, naturally encountered; no Ender Fluidic EndoCrafting spawner required.\"\nkillSource: \"LivingDropsEvent damage source entity must be an EntityPlayer.\"\nquantityPerSuccessfulLootEvent: 1\nprobabilityPerKillGuaranteed: false\nordinaryPlayerNoLootingPerHandlerChance: 0.05000000074505806\npoweredDarkSteelPerHandlerChance: 0.10000000149011612\nnormalPerHandlerFormula: \"vanillaSwordSkullChance + vanillaSwordSkullLootingModifier*lootingLevel = 0.05 + 0.05*L (display-rounded config values).\"\npoweredPerHandlerFormula: \"darkSteelSwordSkullChance + darkSteelSwordSkullLootingModifier*lootingLevel = 0.10 + 0.075*L (display-rounded config values).\"\nfakePlayerMultiplier: 0.5\nticBranch: \"For Enderman killed using TiC cleaver or Beheading tag, separate branch: cleaver base0.10 (otherwise0.05)+0.075*Beheading; this branch returns before ordinary FakePlayer multiplier.\"\nlistenerRegistrations: 3\nlistenerRegistrationEvidence: [\"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/EnderIO/blob/2.10.48/src/main/java/crazypants/enderio/item/darksteel/DarkSteelItems.java#L55\", \"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/EnderIO/blob/2.10.48/src/main/java/crazypants/enderio/item/darksteel/ItemDarkSteelSword.java#L229\", \"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/EnderIO/blob/2.10.48/src/main/java/crazypants/enderio/item/darksteel/ItemEndSteelSword.java#L34\", \"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/EnderIO/blob/2.10.48/src/main/java/crazypants/enderio/item/darksteel/ItemStellarSword.java#L34\"]\neioOnlyProbabilityFormula: \"For three independent handlers, if no prior head drop exists: 1-(1-min(1,p))^3. Duplicate-head guard permits at most one EnderIO-added head.\"\neioOnlyOrdinaryPlayerNoLootingProbability: 0.1426250020172447\nprobabilityScope: \"Formula describes EnderIO source handlers under stated assumptions. Other mods may add their own head drops; do not convert a desired number of heads to guaranteed kills.\"\nconfigSource: \"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/GT-New-Horizons-Modpack/blob/2.9.0-nightly-2026-10-04/config/enderio/EnderIO.cfg#L236\"\nheadMappingSource: \"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/EnderIO/blob/2.10.48/src/main/java/crazypants/enderio/item/darksteel/ItemDarkSteelSword.java#L208\"\nPaso 1: Find a naturally spawned Enderman.\nPaso 2: Kill it as a player; looting/powered Dark Steel/TiC Beheading change per-roll chance.\nPaso 3: Repeat until the Enderman Head drop is obtained; each successful event yields one head."];
"rpatch:verified:rc2:acquisition:enderman-head" -> "ienderio:blockendermanskull" [label="1"];
